## 🔌 Deployment Model (Reference Architecture)

NariBot operates as a modular system integrating multiple layers:

### 1. Telecom Layer
- USSD Gateway (menu-based interaction)
- IVR system (voice-based interaction)

### 2. Application Layer
- NariBot Core (this repository)
- Handles orchestration, routing, and logic execution

### 3. AI Layer
- External LLM provider (e.g., Google Gemini)
- Used for generating contextual livelihood guidance

### 4. Data Layer
- Localized datasets and scheme repositories (not included in this repo)

